{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唷，新……”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 257, "voice": "ht0637", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这样啊，还是不行吗？”", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 257, "voice": "ht0638", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太拍拍我的肩，一脸遗憾。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我好像已经太喜欢美羽学姐，喜欢到糟糕的程度……”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～没想到你会迷恋到这种地步啊。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 257, "voice": "ht0639", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我自己也不敢相信。只要跟那个人在一起，我就没办法冷静。”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“顺带问一下，天羽学姐昨天对你说什么了？”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 257, "voice": "ht0640", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……太可爱了再也不放开我。”", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔欸……”", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 257, "voice": "ht0641", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明明是我离不开她的说。”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过天羽学姐也相当迷恋你呢。”", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 257, "voice": "ht0642", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是吗……”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为你想嘛，那个天羽学姐说不放开你喔！”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 257, "voice": "ht0643", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个人或许也在和某人商量同样的事。”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 257, "voice": "ht0644", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么可能……”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总而言之，你加油吧！人家不是都说三次定胜负吗？”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 257, "voice": "ht0645", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你说的对，我也只能加油了。”", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过也有一句话叫事不过三呢～”", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 257, "voice": "ht0646", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、我会成功的啦！”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "期末考试第三天。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起考试结果，我在另一方面遭遇前所未有的危机……", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐、啊、啊、啊啊……”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 1, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系喔，射很多出来吧？我不希望你忍耐喔。”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1623", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是、我……”", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 3, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样忍耐是不行的……”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1624", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊！？唔唔、啊啊……”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看他一脸难受，我的胸口也好痛苦。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像这样用手让他舒服，光今天就五次了。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明年纪比我小却很可靠的他，只有这种时候才会依赖我。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 8, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君的顶端变得这么红了……”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1625", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊、啊、啊……”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要像这样搓揉，他就会发出好可爱的声音。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还想听更多，所以手上的动作停不下来。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 12, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系喔，射出来吧。我会一直看着你的……”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1626", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊哈啊、哈啊……啊啊……”", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如此拼命忍耐着的他，对我来说就像是某种奖赏。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "强迫他舒服，听到他喊我的名字就会让我好高兴。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊、美羽学姐……”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "性感而沙哑的声音。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他失控的表情，让我变得更大胆。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 19, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君，舒服吗？”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1627", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……”", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老实点头的他好可爱，让我想紧紧抱住。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也没想到自己居然会如此迷恋他。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果他愿意的话，我想一直这样摸他。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想一直看着他舒服的样子。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 25, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“第五次也要射很多出来喔……”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1628", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊、啊！啊啊！啊啊！”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每当他快到达极限，就会主动挺起腰顶着我的手。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道这是他的习惯，于是我靠在他身上继续搓揉顶端。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 29, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就这样射出来……在我的手里……”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1629", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咕！？”", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 31, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯、嗯、可以顶得更用力一点喔……新吾君……新吾君……”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1630", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔！？”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 33, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……啊……出来了……射出来了喔，新吾君……好多……咻咻地射出来了……”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1631", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 34, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“再更抱紧我……舒服得全部都射出来吧？”", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1632", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊、美羽学姐……好厉害……”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到他这么说我好高兴。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然一开始有点害怕，但是他射出来的瞬间真的好惹人怜爱。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还有他瘫软喘气的样子，让我的肚子深处都揪紧了。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但是，我不会告诉他。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不会说我的子宫在发麻。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊……哈啊……美羽学姐……”", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他分开我的双腿，表情认真地注视着我。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "光是这样我的肚子就好难受，好想掉眼泪。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我被摆成无法抵抗的姿势，心中产生一个想法。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想要他的小宝宝……", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以肚子才会这么难受，只是看到他的脸眼泪就要流下来了。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……当然，这种事也不会告诉他。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明还没有过初体验，就想要对方的小孩……这样子应该不对吧。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咦？咦？”", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……怎么了？”", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1633", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他狼狈地拼命用手刺激自己。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么这种时候……”", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为都是借由我的手舒服吗？他的那里变小软下了。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然他挺腰顶向我的私密处，但是性器却微微弯曲，没办法顺利进入。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对不起，美羽学姐……我……”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他满脸通红，正在想办法让自己变大。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连他这个样子都让我觉得可爱得受不了。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 58, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君，不要勉强喔？”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1634", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是……”", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 60, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为今天射出来好多，所以新吾君的那里累了呢……”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1635", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……”", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我按住他的手，然后抱紧他。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他也立刻用力回抱我，抱得我都些痛了，整个人趴在我身上。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的……我是个丢脸的男人，对不起。”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 243, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 65, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不是。”", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1636", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一定是我的错。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我没有魅力，所以他才无法兴奋，没办法顺利完成初体验。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然即使这样我也很幸福，但是我不想看到他消沉的样子。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 69, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉喔，新吾君……”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 250, "voice": "mu1637", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好想快点把第一次给他……", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接受他的全部，也把我的全部献给他……", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
